# The TUI golden harness's toolbar bundle (facelift S5): a small menu whose
# toolbar rows carry icons, a separator and a drop arrow naming the Run menu
# (the shape Chthonia's menu has), so the goldens pin the toolbar's glyphs.
File new New
File editfile Open File…
File save Save [editable]
File -
File quit Quit

Run replrun Run
Run replstop Stop [window]

toolbar new {new} New
toolbar editfile {open} Open
toolbar save {save} Save [editable]
toolbar -
toolbar replrun {run Run} Run
toolbar replstop {stop} Stop [window]
